---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="A little bit about who's behind Ocean Breeze."
>
  <h1>About</h1>
  <div class="page-content card">
    <p>
      Hi, I'm the person behind Ocean Breeze 👋 This is where I write about
      the things I'm working on, thinking about, or just want to remember
      later.
    </p>
    <p>
      Replace this paragraph with your own bio — what you do, what you're
      into, and why you started this site. A sentence or two is plenty; this
      isn't a résumé.
    </p>
    <p>
      Want to get in touch? Head over to the <a href="/contact/"
        >contact page</a
      >.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
